+    close the class. An author who writes the instruction into the CLAIM prose
+    as well as the fix satisfies containment and is admitted again -- executed,
+    and recorded in the guard as a declared residual. The bar it raises is that
+    the unexamined instruction can no longer hide in the fix alone; it must
+    appear in the claim description, which is the field the ledger prints. The
